cause you smoke all the time?”

00:02:40.398 --> 00:02:42.065
Yeah, probably, I’m not a doctor.

00:02:42.066 --> 00:02:43.775
I don’t have an x-ray of
my lungs in front of me

00:02:43.776 --> 00:02:46.068
