species is gonna dramatically

00:10:06.343 --> 00:10:07.385
effect everything.

00:10:07.386 --> 00:10:08.928
I mean just think of it, for example,

00:10:08.930 --> 00:10:10.471
if you were gonna live 1,000 years

00:10:10.473 --> 00:10:12.181
you would do other things, career things,

00:10:12.183 --> 00:10:13.975
or you would go traveling,
or you would just become

00:10:13.976 --> 00:10:17.018
